---
/**
 * One bird that flies as you scroll. The sprite strip (public/art/bird-sprite.webp)
 * is six wing-flap frames; the script in Base.astro moves the bird across its
 * row as the row scrolls through the viewport and picks the frame from the
 * scroll distance. Reduced-motion users get a static, level-winged bird.
 */
---

<div class="flyer" data-flyer aria-hidden="true">
	<div class="flyer__bird"></div>
</div>
